description	"Ice

A precise Duelist focused on positioning and accuracy. 

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Dueling Vibro-Saber (Blue)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- No Blaster Defense/Deflect
- Maximum Charge Pistol (Clone Pistol 2)
-- 2 Shots
-- 100% more velocity
-- 80% less RoF
-- 80% more dmg
-- 80% more FP dmg
-- 60% slower reload
-- Mag Reload
-- Knocks back on hit
- Thermal Grenades (3)

^8Attributes:
- Tracking Beacon
- 80% Faster Cooldowns
- Awareness (Sense 1)
- On Her Toes (Miraluka Vision)
- Dexterity (1)
- Anti MT (1)
- Healing (1)

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (1) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (1) ^3[CS2]
- Binoculars ^3[CS3]
- Advanced Medpack ^3[CS4]"
